{"title":"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems\">2002 AMC 12P #4</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems\">2002 AMC 10P #10</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Note\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Note</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> be distinct real numbers for which\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/3/303291e61ebd979d00d2fb126fd207adb3df898b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{a}{b} + \\frac{a+10b}{b+10a} = 2.\\]\" width=\"132\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/4/084079bf1d54500f3c59257a7ec3467932b72ba2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"34\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/e/d6e786256fef1ab6ebb257083553d8c4b6c8ba82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) }0.4 \\qquad \\text{(B) }0.5  \\qquad \\text{(C) }0.6 \\qquad \\text{(D) }0.7 \\qquad \\text{(E) }0.8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"403\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For sake of speed, WLOG, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/5/cf590e9abb33aa9776ddc386b1ba6ee7b43fa413.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />. This means that the ratio <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/4/084079bf1d54500f3c59257a7ec3467932b72ba2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"34\" /> will simply be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/a/b1afa4c9364c6c6c00f42bc1594e71b99119093c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{b}=\\frac{a}{1}=a.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"92\" height=\"34\" /> Solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> with some very simple algebra gives us a quadratic which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/c/0dca0573e32ecbc8b1c5ebdb8d953a47c88fcc34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5a^2 -9a +4=0.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"139\" height=\"18\" /> Factoring the quadratic gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/2/1124f80c0a2824d270e9dcb0bad5aa139fd5accf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(5a-4)(a-1)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"154\" height=\"20\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/2/502e059d1a020b368aee3a99c5669d88331d321f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/a/79a081a16744387ef785137bc5bc30213568ca21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=\\frac{4}{5}=0.8.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"101\" height=\"38\" /> However, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> must be distinct, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> cannot be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> so the latter option is correct, giving us our answer of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/9/429cde67ed5c867dc4bcf1dfb4025d23095204bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) } 0.8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"70\" height=\"30\" /> for the AMC 12P and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/3/f43548b57efab5d15074a2cae5da789aaf67503f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } 0.8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"71\" height=\"30\" /> for the AMC 10P.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The only tricky part about this equation is the fact that the left-hand side has fractions. Multiplying both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/0/eb0ecb7718c149f49fad114737d87c06ce7f0145.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b(b+10a)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"82\" height=\"20\" /> gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/2/7923f5b1afba351737a6be8de0e2abbde3f300fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2ab+10a^2+10b^2=2b^2+20ab.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"253\" height=\"18\" /> Moving everything to the left-hand side and dividing by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/d/46d4ec3739650b1bed9c92eda19e720573749282.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5a^2-4b^2 -9ab,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"128\" height=\"20\" /> which factors into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/9/be9ca3046ef10a907e4b3e367f9b28db450ce85f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(5a-4b)(a-b)=0.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"166\" height=\"20\" /> Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/e/7becf35cd18a8c248c768ec0fbc8f239def4c38a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\neq b, 5a=4b \\implies \\frac{a}{b}=0.8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"222\" height=\"34\" /> giving us our answer of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/9/429cde67ed5c867dc4bcf1dfb4025d23095204bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) } 0.8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"70\" height=\"30\" /> for the AMC 12P and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/3/f43548b57efab5d15074a2cae5da789aaf67503f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } 0.8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"71\" height=\"30\" /> for the AMC 10P.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Note\">Note</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Note\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>For some unknown reason, the answer choices for the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P\">2002 AMC 10P</a> are different from the answer choices for the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P\">2002 AMC 12P</a>, even though the question is exactly the same. Indeed, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/8/dd8dd5f9c6ad8915c753dbda2d69f75c52cf23e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }0.8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"71\" height=\"30\" /> is the correct answer choice for the 2002 AMC 10P.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P\">2002 AMC 10P</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_9\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_7\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_9\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_10\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_13\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_16\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_17\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_18\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_19\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_20\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_21\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_24\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_25\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_10_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 10 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 10 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P\">2002 AMC 12P</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/